OL,4,Amigrants sinks off Senegal's coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis comes less than two weeks after a
OL,7,Fshipwreck off the coast of the
OL,8,Fnorth-western town of Thieppe killed at
OL,9,Fleast 39 people, in one of Senegal's
OL,10,Fdeadliest migration disasters.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
